# Gitattributes for TechTideOhio/gild
# Treat all scripts, fixtures, docs, and non-core files as vendored/documentation so GitHub detects 100.0% Rust

*.ps1 linguist-vendored
*.sh linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-vendored
*.toml linguist-vendored
*.yml linguist-vendored
*.yaml linguist-vendored
*.md linguist-documentation
security-tests/** linguist-vendored
tests/** linguist-vendored
.github/** linguist-vendored
